# ── Rust / Cargo ──
/target/
debug/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
# Cargo.lock IS committed on purpose: this crate handles secrets, and a
# reproducible build is worth more than a tidy diff.

# ── Editor / OS ──
/.idea/
/.vscode/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Python (the parity tests, and krypto-py) ──
krypto-py/.venv/
krypto-py/tests/__pycache__/

# ── Local secrets ──
# Environment and key files hold secrets and are never committed. Example,
# sample and template files carry no secrets and stay committable.
.env*
*.key
!.env*example*
!.env*sample*
!.env*template*
